    "RawPluginManifestWidget": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Raw `[[widgets]]` entry. No `deny_unknown_fields`: every key besides\n`id` / `slot` / `kind` is a kind-specific widget option captured by the\nflattened `opts` map (the same open shape `[status]` widget tables use).",
